      combining Mateusz's workshop practice with the&nbsp;<b>engineering expertise of a technologist with 20 years of experience</b>&nbsp;in steel construction design.</p>
      
            <h3>What exactly is included in the dWTA02 package?</h3>
            <p>By purchasing this product, you receive a complete set of digital documentation (DXF and PDF files) for the following components:</p>

          <ul class="dots">
     <li>
         <p><b>Comprehensive square set:&nbsp;</b>Plans for flat squares, 3D weldable versions, and squares in the following dimensions: 175x85, 175x125, and 175x175.</p>
    </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Universal stops and spacers:&nbsp;</b>Documentation for precision stops and spacers for rapid part positioning.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Eccentric discs:&nbsp;</b>Plans for discs in two diameter variants: Ø75 and Ø100.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Base elements and extensions:&nbsp;</b>Documentation for a 1000mm weldable extension and a flat protractor.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Workshop organization:&nbsp;</b>Plans for practical pin shelves and clamp racks to be mounted directly on the table.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
         <p><b>Additional modules:&nbsp;</b>Plans for weldable bases in sizes: 350x250, 500x250, 600x250, and 750x250.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
            

         <h3>What’s included in this project?</h3>

          <ul class="dots">
            <li>
              <p><b>Precision DXF files:&nbsp;</b>Ready for laser cutting, optimized for minimal steel waste.</p>
